{
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "slug": "chat-layout",
  "title": "Chat layout",
  "group": "Chat",
  "order": 1,
  "summary": {
    "en": "The conversation column: messages stacked 20 px apart in `.chat`, the history scrolling above a composer that never scrolls away, and a Latest button that appears only when the reader has scrolled up. Newest at the bottom, always.",
    "id": "Kolom percakapan: pesan bertumpuk dengan jarak 20 px di `.chat`, riwayat bergulir di atas composer yang tidak ikut tergulir, dan tombol Terbaru yang muncul hanya saat pembaca menggulir ke atas. Pesan terbaru selalu di bawah."
  },
  "titleId": "Chat layout",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Asking the city services assistant",
        "desc": "Scroll the history up and the Latest button rises in; press it to glide back. Type a question and press Enter: your message joins the column.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" id=\"cl-scroll\" style=\"height: 320px;\">\n    <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cl-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation with the city services assistant\">\n      <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today, 09:12</p>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Why was my family card change for Kedaton sent back?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:12</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">The surat pengantar from your RT/RW was not attached. Disdukcapil needs it to confirm your new address in Kedaton. Upload the letter on the same application and it goes back in the queue with the same number.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"Attach the surat pengantar RT/RW to the same application; it keeps its queue number.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Do I need to bring the original letter too?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:14</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Only at the counter. Online, a clear photo of the stamped letter is enough. Bring the original when you collect the new family card at the Kedaton district office.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"Online, a photo of the stamped letter is enough; bring the original when you collect the card.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">When can I collect it?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:15</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Family card changes in Bandar Lampung are usually ready 3 working days after the documents are complete. You will get a message when it is ready to collect.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy answer\" data-lds-copy=\"Family card changes are usually ready 3 working days after the documents are complete.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Try again\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Share answer\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"cl-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Latest</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); const c = document.getElementById('cl-chat'); c.insertBefore(m, c.querySelector('.chat__jump')); const s = document.getElementById('cl-scroll'); s.scrollTo({ top: s.scrollHeight, behavior: 'smooth' });\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message the assistant\" placeholder=\"Ask about this application\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chat-scroll\" id=\"chat-scroll\"><!-- your scroller: overflow-y: auto, flex: 1 -->\n  <div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Conversation with the city services assistant\">\n    <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today, 09:12</p>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Why was my family card change for Kedaton sent back?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09:12</span></div>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">The surat pengantar from your RT/RW was not attached…</div>\n      <div class=\"msg__actions\">…</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"chat-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Latest</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message the assistant\" placeholder=\"Ask about this application\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => sendToAssistant(e.detail.text));\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "System lines mark what changed",
        "desc": "Day breaks, a mode switching on, a file joining the conversation: centered footnote lines, no bubble, no actions. They are part of the history, so they scroll with it.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Business permit help\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Yesterday</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Check my UMKM business permit documents, one by one.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Ready. I will go through the five documents in order; answer yes when each one is ready to upload.</div></div>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Guided mode is on. The form stays locked until every document is checked.</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">You attached surat-keterangan-domisili.pdf</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Today</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Submit my application.</div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Before the first message",
        "desc": "An empty conversation says what the assistant can do and offers two or three starting questions as chips. A chip fills the composer; the person still presses send.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">id_card</span></div>\n    <p class=\"empty__title\">Ask about Disdukcapil services</p>\n    <p class=\"empty__body\">Answers use the published service requirements and say which page they come from.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chip-row\" style=\"justify-content: center;\">\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">How to get an electronic KTP</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Requirements for a moving letter</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Samsat keliling schedule</button>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Message\" placeholder=\"Ask a question\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Send\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"empty\">\n  <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">id_card</span></div>\n  <p class=\"empty__title\">Ask about Disdukcapil services</p>\n  <p class=\"empty__body\">Answers use the published service requirements and say which page they come from.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chip-row\">\n  <button class=\"chip\">How to get an electronic KTP</button>\n  <button class=\"chip\">Requirements for a moving letter</button>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>…</form>\n<!-- On a chip click: put its text in the textarea, dispatch 'input' (enables send), focus it. -->"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Bertanya ke asisten layanan kota",
        "desc": "Gulir riwayat ke atas dan tombol Terbaru muncul; tekan untuk meluncur kembali. Ketik pertanyaan lalu tekan Enter: pesan Anda masuk ke kolom.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"docs-scroll\" id=\"cl-scroll\" style=\"height: 320px;\">\n    <div class=\"chat\" id=\"cl-chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Percakapan dengan asisten layanan kota\">\n      <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini, 09.12</p>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kenapa permohonan perubahan KK saya untuk Kedaton dikembalikan?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.12</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Surat pengantar dari RT/RW belum dilampirkan. Disdukcapil memerlukannya untuk memastikan alamat baru Anda di Kedaton. Unggah suratnya pada permohonan yang sama, lalu permohonan kembali masuk antrean dengan nomor yang sama.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Lampirkan surat pengantar RT/RW pada permohonan yang sama; nomor antreannya tetap.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Apakah surat aslinya juga perlu dibawa?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.14</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Hanya bila Anda mengurus di loket. Secara daring, foto surat yang sudah dicap dan terbaca jelas sudah cukup. Bawa aslinya saat mengambil KK baru di kantor Kecamatan Kedaton.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Secara daring, foto surat yang sudah dicap sudah cukup; bawa aslinya saat mengambil KK.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kapan KK-nya bisa diambil?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.15</span></div>\n      <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Perubahan KK di Bandar Lampung biasanya selesai 3 hari kerja setelah berkas lengkap. Anda akan menerima pesan saat KK siap diambil.</div><div class=\"msg__actions\"><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Salin jawaban\" data-lds-copy=\"Perubahan KK biasanya selesai 3 hari kerja setelah berkas lengkap.\"><span class=\"swap\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"ic swap__a\">content_copy</span><span class=\"ic swap__b\">check</span></span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Coba lagi\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">refresh</span></button><button class=\"icon-btn\" aria-label=\"Bagikan jawaban\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">share</span></button></div></div>\n      <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"cl-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Terbaru</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer onsubmit=\"event.preventDefault(); const t = this.querySelector('textarea').value.trim(); if (!t) return; const m = document.createElement('div'); m.className = 'msg msg--me is-new'; const b = document.createElement('div'); b.className = 'bubble'; b.textContent = t; m.append(b); const c = document.getElementById('cl-chat'); c.insertBefore(m, c.querySelector('.chat__jump')); const s = document.getElementById('cl-scroll'); s.scrollTo({ top: s.scrollHeight, behavior: 'smooth' });\"><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Kirim pesan ke asisten\" placeholder=\"Tanyakan tentang permohonan ini\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"chat-scroll\" id=\"chat-scroll\"><!-- your scroller: overflow-y: auto, flex: 1 -->\n  <div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Percakapan dengan asisten layanan kota\">\n    <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini, 09.12</p>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Kenapa permohonan perubahan KK saya untuk Kedaton dikembalikan?</div><span class=\"msg__meta\">09.12</span></div>\n    <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Surat pengantar dari RT/RW belum dilampirkan…</div>\n      <div class=\"msg__actions\">…</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--sm chat__jump\" data-lds-jump=\"chat-scroll\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_downward</span>Terbaru</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>\n  <textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Kirim pesan ke asisten\" placeholder=\"Tanyakan tentang permohonan ini\"></textarea>\n  <button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button>\n</form>\n<script type=\"module\">\n  import { init } from 'lampung-design-system/js';\n  init();\n  document.querySelector('.composer').addEventListener('lds:send', (e) => sendToAssistant(e.detail.text));\n</script>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Baris sistem menandai perubahan",
        "desc": "Pergantian hari, mode yang dinyalakan, berkas yang ditambahkan ke percakapan: baris footnote di tengah, tanpa bubble, tanpa aksi. Baris ini bagian dari riwayat, jadi ikut tergulir.",
        "html": "<div class=\"chat\" role=\"log\" aria-label=\"Bantuan izin usaha\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Kemarin</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Periksa berkas izin usaha UMKM saya, satu per satu.</div></div>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--ai\"><div class=\"bubble\">Siap. Saya periksa lima berkas secara berurutan; jawab ya bila tiap berkas siap diunggah.</div></div>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Mode terpandu aktif. Formulir terkunci sampai semua berkas diperiksa.</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Anda melampirkan surat-keterangan-domisili.pdf</p>\n  <p class=\"msg msg--system\">Hari ini</p>\n  <div class=\"msg msg--me\"><div class=\"bubble\">Ajukan permohonan saya.</div></div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Sebelum pesan pertama",
        "desc": "Percakapan kosong menjelaskan apa yang bisa dilakukan asisten dan menawarkan dua atau tiga pertanyaan pembuka sebagai chip. Chip mengisi composer; orang tetap menekan kirim.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-col\" style=\"max-width: 560px;\">\n  <div class=\"empty\">\n    <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">id_card</span></div>\n    <p class=\"empty__title\">Tanya tentang layanan Disdukcapil</p>\n    <p class=\"empty__body\">Jawaban memakai persyaratan layanan yang sudah diumumkan dan menyebut halaman sumbernya.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"chip-row\" style=\"justify-content: center;\">\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Cara mengurus KTP elektronik</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Syarat surat pindah</button>\n    <button class=\"chip\" onclick=\"const t = this.closest('.docs-col').querySelector('textarea'); t.value = this.textContent; t.dispatchEvent(new Event('input')); t.focus();\">Jadwal Samsat keliling</button>\n  </div>\n  <form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer><textarea rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"Pesan\" placeholder=\"Ajukan pertanyaan\"></textarea><button class=\"composer__send\" type=\"submit\" aria-label=\"Kirim\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">arrow_upward</span></button></form>\n</div>",
        "code": "<div class=\"empty\">\n  <div class=\"empty__icon\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">id_card</span></div>\n  <p class=\"empty__title\">Tanya tentang layanan Disdukcapil</p>\n  <p class=\"empty__body\">Jawaban memakai persyaratan layanan yang sudah diumumkan dan menyebut halaman sumbernya.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"chip-row\">\n  <button class=\"chip\">Cara mengurus KTP elektronik</button>\n  <button class=\"chip\">Syarat surat pindah</button>\n</div>\n<form class=\"composer\" data-lds-composer>…</form>\n<!-- On a chip click: put its text in the textarea, dispatch 'input' (enables send), focus it. -->"
      }
    ]
  },
